    "noteZh": "深色首屏，正中大标题 Prebuilt Chakra UI Components for faster development（Chakra UI 与 Components 几个词是紫色渐变）；导航只有 Choc UI 与 Sponsor，顶部中间是 Search the collection... 搜索框并标着 ⌘K 快捷键，右上角排着 Twitter、Discord、GitHub 和主题切换四个图标。正文四条特性是 Live Editor（先在线试代码再抽走）、Light and Dark UI、Fully Responsive 与 Opinionated and designed for daily use，页面底部写着 We're open source，并列出赞助者头像与 Sponsor Choc UI 按钮。",
